        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gukomera kw'Imana n'intege nke z'abantu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa birwa mwe, nimucecekere imbere yanjye, abanyamahanga basubiremo imbaraga nshya bigire hafi bavuge, maze duterane tuburane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde wahagurukije uva iburasirazuba, akamuhamagaza gukiranuka ngo agere ku birenge bye. Amugabije amahanga, amuha gutwara abami, abagabiza inkota ye ibahindura nk'umukungugu, abagabiza n'umuheto we abahindura nk'ibishingwe bitumurwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arabirukana akahanyura amahoro, anyuze mu nzira atigeze gukandagiramo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde wabikoze akabisohoza, agategeka ibihe uhereye mbere na mbere? Ni jyewe Uwiteka, uwa mbere n'uw'imperuka. Ndi we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibirwa byararebye biratinya, impera z'isi zihinda umushyitsi, abo ku mpera z'isi bigira hafi baraza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese yatabaye umuturanyi we, akabwira mugenzi we ati “Komera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze umubaji akomeza umucuzi, uhwika akomeza ucura akavuga ngo “Ibyuma twabiteranije neza.” Maze akagikomeresha imisumari ngo cye kunyeganyega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngoma 20.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yak 2.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ariko weho Isirayeli umugaragu wanjye, Yakobo natoranije, rubyaro rwa Aburahamu incuti yanjye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weho nahamagaye, nkagukura ku mpera z'isi no mu mfuruka zayo nkakubwira nti “Uri umugaragu wanjye, naragutoranije sinaguciye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntutinye kuko ndi kumwe nawe, ntukihebe kuko ndi Imana yawe. Nzajya ngukomeza, ni koko nzajya ngutabara kandi nzajya nkuramiza ukuboko kw'iburyo, ari ko gukiranuka kwanjye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dore abakurakariye bose bazakorwa n'isoni bamware, abagutonganya bazahinduka ubusa ndetse bazarimbuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakugisha impaka uzabashaka ubabure, kandi abakurwanya bazahinduka ubusa babe nk'ibitariho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko jyewe Uwiteka Imana yawe nzagufata ukuboko kw'iburyo nkubwire nti ‘Witinya, ndagutabaye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Witinya, Yakobo wa munyorogoto we namwe bagabo b'Abisirayeli, ni jye uzagutabara.” Ni ko Uwiteka avuga kandi ni we Uwera wa Isirayeli umucunguzi wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dore nzakugira umuhuzo mushya w'ubugi ufite amenyo, uzahūra imisozi ukayimenagura, n'udusozi ukaduhindura nk'ibishingwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzabigosora umuyaga ubitumure, umuyaga wa serwakira ubitatanye, nawe uzishimira Uwiteka wiratane Uwera wa Isirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abakene n'abatindi bashaka amazi bakayabura ururimi rwabo rukagwa umwuma, jyeweho Uwiteka nzabasubiza, jyeho Imana ya Isirayeli sinzabahāna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzazibura imigezi mu mpinga z'imisozi n'amasōko mu bikombe hagati, ubutayu nzabuhindura ibidendezi by'amazi, n'igihugu cyumye nzagihindura amasōko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu butayu nzahatera imyerezi n'imishita, n'imihadasi n'ibiti by'amavuta, kandi mu kidaturwa nzahatera ibiti by'imiberoshi n'imitidari n'imiteyashuri bikurane, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngo barebe bitegereze, batekereze bamenyere hamwe yuko ukuboko k'Uwiteka ari ko kubikoze, kandi yuko Uwera wa Isirayeli ari we ubiremye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nimushinge urubanza rwanyu”, ni ko Uwiteka avuga. “Muburane imanza zanyu zikomeye.” Ni ko Umwami wa Yakobo avuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nibazane ibigirwamana byabo bitubwire ibizaba, nibivuge ibyabayeho uko bimeze, tubitekereze tumenye amaherezo yabyo cyangwa mutubwire ibyenda kubaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimuduhanurire ibizaba hanyuma tumenye ko muri imana koko, nimukore ibyiza cyangwa ibibi tubirebe twumirwe twese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore nta cyo muri cyo kandi nta n'icyo mwakora, uwabahitamo aba abaye ikizira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ngira uwo nahagurukije aturutse ikasikazi, dore araje avuye iburasirazuba akambaza izina ryanjye, azakāta abatware nk'ukāta urwondo cyangwa nk'uko umubumbyi akāta ibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde wabivuze ubwa mbere ngo tubimenye, cyangwa ni nde wabivuze kera ngo tuvuge ko ari ukuri? Ni ukuri koko nta wabivuze, ni ukuri nta wabimenyekanishije, ni ukuri nta n'umwe wumvise amagambo yanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jye wabanje kubwira i Siyoni nti ‘Dore ngabo!’ Kandi i Yerusalemu nzahatuma intumwa yo kubabwira ubutumwa bwiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi iyo ndebye muri bo ubwabo mbona nta muntu, nta n'umujyanama wabasha kunsubiza mbabajije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dore bose imirimo yabo ni ubusa kandi nta cyo imaze, ibishushanyo byabo biyagijwe ni umuyaga kandi ni imivurungano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
